+| S08 | `semantic.k:101-102` | recursively evaluate `*`, then `mulVal` | Sound; submitted operands are pure |
+| S09 | `semantic.k:103-104` | recursively evaluate `%`, then `modVal` | Sound; reached divisor is the nonzero integer 2 |
